Scope,Assumptions and Constraints

IN SCOPE
-Students submits a request for a letter of completion through the system
-System checks the student records for completion status, the number of credits completed 
-Staff review and approves or rejects the request
-System generates a letter of completion if approved or generates a rejection letter if not approved
-Student downloads the letter

OUT OF SCOPE
-Changing official university grades
-Registering students for courses
-Calculating tuition fees
-Processing graduation ceremonies
-Changing university policies

ASSUMPTIONS
-Authorised staff are responsible for final approval
-Programme requirements are defined and available to the system
-Studnets have a university login/ID or email accounts

CONSTRAINTS
-the project should be completed in one semester
-The prototype must not use confidential student records
-The team has limited access to lecturer-approved technology


